### 7.2 Check it with `check_data.py`

```bash
python python/check_data.py data/test.csv ; echo "exit code: $?"
```

```
Dataset: data/test.csv
Total frames: 1801

Message counts:
0x100: 1000 frames
0x200: 501 frames
0x300: 200 frames
0x400: 100 frames

Timing checks:
0x100: average gap=10.00 ms, deviation=0.01% -> PASS
0x200: average gap=20.00 ms, deviation=0.00% -> PASS
